Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 1{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone said it was the wedding of the century.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The heiress to Korea's\Nmost-powerful conglomerate...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}married a new recruit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}It's been three years already,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but it seems like only yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}People ask me how it feels to become a part...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}of a conglomerate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and live with a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Would you believe me if I said this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}a lucky man...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}who married...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know people gossiped about...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,how Baek Hyun-woo married me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,solely because of my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and our wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rumors only began because\NI chose not to reveal my face...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,for various reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this'll put an end to those rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm finally revealing my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our married life...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,is nothing out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wake up next to her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have breakfast together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We go to work together too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does it feel...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to be together all day and night?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,After returning from my\Nstudies abroad five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I joined Queens Department Store,\Nwhich my father owned at the time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.21,0:03:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as an intern.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You could say I was working undercover.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Women know these things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"I see."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"This guy likes me."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"That's why he's flirting with me."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept kicking the photocopier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}So I was worried.{\i0}\N- What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}About the photocopier.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But after helping her a few times,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I started worrying about her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When sending a fax...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the time, people were\Ngossiping about how obnoxious...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the new intern was,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I was sure she'd get fired soon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to stop, Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done my fair share of part-time jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get yourself fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You'll just find another job,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get fired there, too.\NDo you want to bet on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart jumps every time\Nyour superior scolds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scolded every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Why does your heart jump,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,when I'm the one who's getting scolded?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You always need help, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I made your heart jump, and now I bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you this in case it'd\Nmake you feel uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to Seoul National University,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and law school at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents live down south,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but the community respects our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, we own over 30 cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Another calf was born a couple of days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have almost 35 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As for my studio apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I signed a two-year lease...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of paying monthly rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It just means I have a good\Nchunk of money on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you get fired and can't find a new job,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest. I've always\Nwanted my future wife to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but if it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can try being the sole breadwinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't feel pressured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to answer me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- I...\N- I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Baek...\N- I'm really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hilarious, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been a romantic ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how our love story began,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was shocked after\Nfinding out who my family was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He handed in his resignation letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and ghosted me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo, come out.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to leave me standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked like an angel sent from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's how she looked back then.\N- But not anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, she's still an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:10:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,have a happy married life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still very much in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Baek Hyun-woo is getting a divorce.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a secret.\N- Of course. We're colleagues, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he'd like one of us to represent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the #1 divorce attorney in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do it, Yang-gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,love to help him. Really,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm already juggling so many cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Attorney Choi Cheol-seung boasts a 90% win rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll secretly help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why secretly? Do it openly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of getting on Queens' bad side...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and losing your job, you sly scumbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crazy to take that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo's aunt-in-law got divorced three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You all know the fates of\Nher ex-husbands' attorneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo made a mistake. Why would\Nhe put us in a pickle like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Exactly.\N- Let's be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the smartest one out of us.\NAlways the top of our classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so why can't he just be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- his own divorce attorney?\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- That'd be better.\N- I'll bet he'll excel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why does he want a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. He's living the\Ndream life of all Korean men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife is Hong Hae-in,\Nthe heiress of Queens Group,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,so why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A lunatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. About that One Billion Club group chat...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Why haven't they invited me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sales are only at $880 million, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a big gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're only about $100 million short.\N- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked them to just round it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and be more flexible,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was still a hard no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they so fussy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that Royal Department Store is\Nbragging about how their CEO...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,will join the One Billion\NClub by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're also boasting that\Nthey're going to set up Hercyna...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,on the first floor next to the fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it. Department stores in Korea...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are divided into those who have\NHercyna and those who don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and Hercyna only wants to work\Nwith those who are in that club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we cut off all the brands...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that hinder our sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our periodical evaluation chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,At the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,we have a list of brands in\Nthe bottom 20% of sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of them can we shut down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those underlined in red\Nwere in the bottom 20%...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at least twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In principle, they should\Nbe shut down. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"However"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a "however"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We should shut them down if we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We did ask our legal team for advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and they said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yu, please wrap up the\Ncontract after confirming...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the commission fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The second-floor manager submitted a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One of our customers fell and injured herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,while walking in 5-inch heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the CEO would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants to see you\Nimmediately. She's very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we shut down\Nbrands that aren't profitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of the brands invested\N$500,000 in equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just kick them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,File an eviction suit, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The law has been revised many\Ntimes to prevent large distributors...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,from abusing their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a power trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's not what I...\N- Is this a nonprofit organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it right to let them be,\Nwhen we're not getting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,our money's worth for those expensive spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sales division has deliberately excluded...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,brands with low performance scores...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,from customer-invitation events and\Ndiscounts to hinder additional sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brands could complain\Nto the media or sue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'd really be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe a more favorable\Nsolution would be to help...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,improve their sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I ask for your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to shut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't listen, file a lawsuit and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's your team's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This meeting's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you eager to let others\Nknow we don't get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our relationship has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you warned the\Nstore manager I wanted to fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,about the violations beforehand\Nto help him stay afloat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That manager has been\Nwith us since the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's still just as hard-working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. You're awfully kind and caring to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be a hero or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit playing the martyr and\Ntreat those close to you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those close to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we're close?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the lounge in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Are you on your way? I'm here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Where are you? Forget it. I'm leaving.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Come to the family room.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I texted him late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to remind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows we have a family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of interview was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the culture section\Nof "Hanyang Economic Daily."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heartwarming interview\Nwhere CEOs and politicians...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,show their houses and families.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They were both interviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why show the house? They're not celebrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to do something about the tabloids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.35,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. People gossiped about\Nhow they were separated last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because they see you arguing at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- You argued?\N- Yes, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a simple argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quite uncomfortable\Nfor those in the meeting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Hyun-woo. About\Nthe Fair Trade Commission...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They keep calling us in for trivial matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take care of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You should ask the legal team of Queens Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just too dense,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're quick-thinking and smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and the higher-ups at the Fair\NTrade Commission love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our own jurisdictions...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just say you'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,People need to stop gossiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you contacted Dr. Joo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I booked an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll get the prenatal checkup,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,then begin the procedure right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Hyun-woo, after the baby is born,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.61,0:20:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll go to Boston...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,within the next two years to get an MBA.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in getting a degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also said...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't owe us a grandkid,\Nso stop pressuring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink your tea, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to meet Su-bin in May.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Su-bin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think? It's my future granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name means "remarkably shining."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, right? Hong Su-bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she be Hong Su-bin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of Baek Su-bin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want her to have her mom's surname?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to follow the patriarchal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's quite old-fashioned\Nto use the father's surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I asked you about\Ngiving Geon-u his mom's surname,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you said it was nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the same? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having a baby, despite\Neverything that's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be going abroad alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.92,0:22:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you want me to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do your part and go abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have others raise our baby, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's convenient and nice. What's the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.03,0:22:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them I'd like to sign\Noff before they publish the article?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to introduce Director Baek properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to mention he studied law at SNU.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing these interviews. I'm done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do them alone if you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I, when they're about married couples?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell them all about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them how we're so in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.95,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and happily married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a lie, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the photos first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.39,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pick the one they'll use.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.91,0:24:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they publish useless articles?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.58,0:24:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't they mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.74,0:24:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,how I anonymously donated $200,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I did it anonymously,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.67,0:24:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,because I didn't want anyone to\Nknow, but everyone should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what the PR team is for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.69,0:24:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Soo-cheol.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.29,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't avoid me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll get...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a black eye and start bawling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.79,0:25:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.67,0:25:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.01,0:25:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Hyun-woo your friend or\Nsomeone younger than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.88,0:25:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Quick-thinking"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.02,0:25:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Disrespect my husband again,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Answer me.\N- Fine. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.11,0:25:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why get angry with me, when she\Nbullies Hyun-woo all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She's seriously a psychopath!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants you to reconsider this divorce,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.48,0:26:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and just live with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted me to tell you that. Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.90,0:26:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Are you already drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? You're making my heart flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.07,0:26:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently I'm cute when I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.87,0:26:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- She said that was my special move.\N- Who said?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She said...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you bragging?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.59,0:26:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was I like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.22,0:26:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was I cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I use my special move and look cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I make her heart flutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.27,0:26:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And as a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.02,0:26:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I ruined...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.27,0:26:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have gotten married\Nif I hadn't been so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This lunatic is totally wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:26:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife has been calling me,\Nasking me to buy diapers for our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.87,0:27:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too cute when I'm drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been known as "the cute\Nson of the pear-tree house in Yongdu-ri."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.34,0:27:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.80,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.10,0:27:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're not going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.52,0:27:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taken home safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.98,0:27:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll prevent all scandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.05,0:28:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I tear leaves off a branch...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,to see if I should get a divorce or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I always end up with a "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.15,0:28:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.15,0:28:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.66,0:28:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single leaf that's on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.83,0:28:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anyone on my side.\NI just want to own a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.79,0:28:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That building will be on my side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife's mood is like a roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd be smiling in the\Nmorning then raging at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.83,0:28:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it my fault we're out of diapers?\NWhy did she get angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.77,0:28:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Concrete buildings don't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't nag or get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.19,0:28:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.48,0:28:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}Who said{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}love{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.88,0:29:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}was beautiful?{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.01,0:29:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.85,0:29:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna keep watching me cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just crying on my way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.45,0:29:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you going that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}Put me to sleep{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.68,0:30:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}with your fair hands{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.01,0:32:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Lawyer Identification Card\NBaek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.70,0:32:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't he the son-in-law of Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.45,0:32:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Son-in-law, my foot. He's pretty much a butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he cleans up his in-laws' messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.50,0:32:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's his self-respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.50,0:32:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have married\Ninto that family if he had any.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.67,0:32:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an embarrassment to all attorneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.64,0:33:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.90,0:33:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallelujah, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.19,0:33:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I have $25 million in my account?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.15,0:33:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even use it to buy dental floss in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.26,0:33:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how did you come up with this idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.45,0:33:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is actually illegal, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.00,0:33:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How long must I be locked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't commit that big of a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.83,0:33:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Seul-hee was the\Nwhistleblower who reported me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,for embezzlement, so I grabbed her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.29,0:33:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.34,0:33:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She had to receive treatment for four weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it. I should've hospitalized her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the reason my mom passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.55,0:33:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see. I'll take my revenge on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.60,0:33:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.15,0:33:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.44,0:33:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.61,0:33:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fully aware of that, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.82,0:33:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of my ex-husbands\Nhave left this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.65,0:33:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought hell to them all and their relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.24,0:34:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Married couples can eventually separate,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so why did you have to go that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.79,0:34:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Divorce is brutal and messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no "good" bye in divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The best solution is for one of them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I marry and divorce again in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.18,0:34:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you to take my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.89,0:34:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.47,0:34:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,already thinking about getting another divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think marriage and divorce go hand in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.90,0:34:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of marriage and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.73,0:34:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.40,0:34:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.86,0:34:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost a lot of hair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.41,0:34:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is teeming with wenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become like\Nthem if I stay here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.83,0:34:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom's memorial service is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.55,0:34:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad will settle this before then...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.63,0:34:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,for her sake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm currently in front of Queens Town...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.55,0:34:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in Hanil-dong, Yongsan-gu,\NSeoul where the memorial service...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.27,0:34:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,of Yang Mi-suk, the\NQueens' chairman's late wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.42,0:35:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,is taking place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.51,0:35:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The family members are arriving one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.39,0:35:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, Hong Beom-seok,\Nthe chairman's eldest son...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.85,0:35:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and former CEO of Queens Distribution,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.68,0:35:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,flew in from Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.23,0:35:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a keen interest...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,in whether or not the chairman\Nand his son will reconcile...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,after their long-time feud.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, can you take a look at my pancakes?\NDo you think the insides are cooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.95,0:35:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You studied chemistry in Harvard,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.12,0:35:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.91,0:35:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Judging by the color,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.58,0:35:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're well-cooked. Flip them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I'll do the plating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you who graduated\Nfrom Parsons School of Design?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,His family have been architects for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.01,0:35:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,His family made the big sculpture...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.93,0:35:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- in front of the Louvre.\N- I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.89,0:35:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty confident about stacking up food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.35,0:35:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.98,0:35:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear brothers-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.78,0:36:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mr. Choi. He\Nmarried Min-hee, our relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.61,0:36:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.74,0:36:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.07,0:36:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, powerful\Nfamilies such as royalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,made the male members prepare\Neverything for memorial services.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.16,0:36:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman has great\Ninterest in royal traditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.25,0:36:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,so we've been doing this for a few years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.67,0:36:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.63,0:36:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.80,0:36:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be why traditions\Nand the future go well together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.68,0:36:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't old-fashioned.\NIt's quite progressive and nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.43,0:36:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It fits the current trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's so progressive, nice, and trendy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.06,0:36:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.23,0:36:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been going to church since last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.48,0:36:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so this is against my religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.23,0:36:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born a Christian.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.28,0:36:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.91,0:36:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,where I can't smell oil. It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.66,0:36:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.63,0:36:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.71,0:36:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Hong family's memorial service,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.75,0:37:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but no one here has that surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.09,0:37:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They should prepare their own memorial services.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- I'm the fifth only son...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.01,0:37:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Yu family in\NPaechon County, 39th generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.35,0:37:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What would my mother say if she saw\Nme complete this skewer in ten seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.85,0:37:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not talk about how precious we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.14,0:37:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.98,0:37:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Welcome.\N- Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.15,0:37:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.82,0:37:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd run away right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.62,0:37:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late, since it's\Nhis first memorial service.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.91,0:37:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the color? Does it look too dull?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.33,0:37:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jade green isn't an easy color.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only seen two people\Nwho looked good in that color.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and Yuna Kim at the London Fashion Show.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.05,0:37:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Her? Yes, she looked really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And so do you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.14,0:37:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how to please others.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Moh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.36,0:38:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you wearing the\N{\i1}hanbok{\i0} that was sent to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be at this memorial service.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The family can do it without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.03,0:38:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been with us for over\N20 years, so you're family too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.66,0:38:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what family is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you,\Nbut I'll just stay in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.67,0:38:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,People will talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.42,0:38:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,about how I shove you around and mistreat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.05,0:38:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shove you around"? Who shoves who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.56,0:38:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you shove her around?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.27,0:38:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Shove her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.73,0:38:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Father. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.07,0:38:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.57,0:38:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You only said that because\Nthat's how you think of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.41,0:38:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.03,0:38:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't want to wear a {\i1}hanbok.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why not?\N- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.58,0:39:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.71,0:39:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.05,0:39:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.63,0:39:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.73,0:39:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crazy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.19,0:39:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I'm so stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.53,0:39:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a sly one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to brazenly attend\NMs. Yang's memorial service...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,because the chairman insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.58,0:39:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.33,0:39:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew a girlfriend-in-law\Ncould be worse than a mother-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.02,0:40:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.75,0:40:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.46,0:40:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was she discharged today?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.01,0:40:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You said she'd get sick if she\Nstayed locked up in this cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.80,0:40:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.47,0:40:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you should've waited to let\Nher out after the memorial service.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.73,0:40:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Look at that good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.94,0:40:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.11,0:40:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thoughtless, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.99,0:40:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.62,0:41:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad put his one-and-only daughter behind bars,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,just because I grabbed his\Ngirlfriend by the hair and kicked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.84,0:41:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.01,0:41:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're head-over-heels for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.76,0:41:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are you in love with\Nthe woman who killed your wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.55,0:41:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but you sent your daughter to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.10,0:41:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja, this is Mom's memorial\Nservice. Let's talk later. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.10,0:41:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no different. Have\Nyou forgotten who she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.86,0:41:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom died because of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.69,0:41:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom died of a heart attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! Why do you think she had it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.16,0:41:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart stopped because she\Nwas enraged at Moh Seul-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.53,0:41:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So how can you stand looking\Nat her every day and night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.50,0:41:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Beom-ja, I...\N- Gosh, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.00,0:41:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of having a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.17,0:41:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even prepare\Nskate, her favorite food,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.55,0:41:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so who are you to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.88,0:41:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Beom-ja, we have skate.\NThe house reeks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.18,0:42:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.39,0:42:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you never visit\Nme when I raised you myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.77,0:42:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't raise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.56,0:42:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just serving the alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.48,0:42:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We should continue, then. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn the glass slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a lightweight.\NYou're going to get her drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.09,0:42:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom drank like a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.34,0:42:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fact we both know to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.35,0:42:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think she drank so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that woman stressed her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.23,0:42:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.36,0:42:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it break your heart to\Nknow your sister passed away...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.78,0:42:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,because she was outraged\Nby that woman? Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.74,0:43:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja, that's not why she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.16,0:43:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She died of a heart attack.\NIt runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- You should be careful too.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.83,0:43:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.12,0:43:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.13,0:43:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.30,0:43:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This family is a total disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.80,0:43:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.22,0:43:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink the alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.72,0:43:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You should make a U-turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.94,0:43:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hong, you finally came back after\N19 years. Will you rejoin Queens...?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.18,0:43:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be attending your\Nmother's memorial service?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.51,0:43:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be meeting Chairman Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.11,0:43:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you two reconciled?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.79,0:43:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit. He'll leave eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I despise him more.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.17,0:43:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk didn't come to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.88,0:44:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to get his photo taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.09,0:44:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.47,0:44:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's purposely standing\Nin the rain for the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.26,0:44:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.93,0:44:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who cooked all those pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.77,0:44:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see my hands trembling?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.11,0:44:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But they don't even allow\Nus to attend the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.35,0:44:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, I spend a lot of time\Non internet forums about mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.29,0:44:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can relate to many of their posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.39,0:44:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember the last time\NI visited my parents on the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.37,0:44:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they'd let us go once we cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.44,0:44:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Wait for your aunt-in-law."\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.18,0:44:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wait for your uncle-in-law."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.51,0:44:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Chop some apples."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.56,0:44:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Serve the pancakes."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.75,0:44:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what about our families?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.88,0:44:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is Hyun-woo's father's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.09,0:44:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his 60th birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.80,0:44:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but he could visit him because\Nof this memorial service.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.05,0:44:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I pity him the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.97,0:44:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me too.\N- Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wives are their cousins,\Nbut he married the direct line. Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,His in-laws...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.14,0:44:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,are all terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.23,0:44:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}They are.\N- They are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.44,0:44:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.73,0:45:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been attending the\Nmemorial service for 20 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.36,0:45:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She always treated me well.\NOf course I should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.99,0:45:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you submitted your resignation letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.03,0:45:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but I really don't want to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.67,0:45:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard\Nbefore making that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.62,0:45:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll be too old to have a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.67,0:45:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. It can't be helped, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.09,0:45:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.46,0:45:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into him. It's odd\Nfor him to quit so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.84,0:45:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.30,0:45:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into him discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.01,0:45:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, everyone should know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.02,0:45:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out what he did and let\Nthe media see him going to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.81,0:45:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My purpose isn't to punish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.48,0:45:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to humiliate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.36,0:45:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you wish to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.74,0:45:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I never allow those who\Nturn their backs on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.24,0:45:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to leave in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.37,0:45:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They need to suffer on their way out,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.29,0:45:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so they won't cause further troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.59,0:46:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.05,0:46:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.38,0:46:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But he devoted many years to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.76,0:46:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it right to cut him off...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.18,0:46:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so brutally?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably what he'll think,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.78,0:46:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's his opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.11,0:46:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe an organization must follow its rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just him. I'm after anyone\Nelse who has the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.29,0:46:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a warning to those\Nwho want to back-stab me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.33,0:46:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir.\N- Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.33,0:46:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- You should never bid farewell...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.96,0:46:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to those who abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.42,0:46:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stab them in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.84,0:46:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.43,0:46:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.35,0:46:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.65,0:47:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.16,0:47:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have an appetite.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.25,0:47:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like my appetite is completely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.71,0:47:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's suffocating to be around many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.51,0:47:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stress levels seem to be extremely high.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.26,0:47:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on your sentence completion test,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.22,0:47:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you wrote that your biggest desire right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.73,0:47:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.89,0:47:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Correct.\N- I see... And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.65,0:47:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I live with my parents-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.57,0:47:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and my grandfather-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.07,0:47:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.24,0:47:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as my recently-discharged aunt-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and my brother-in-law's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.95,0:47:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We all live...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.54,0:48:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.79,0:48:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.92,0:48:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see extended families\Nthese days. You're blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.42,0:48:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so blessed that we\Nhave dinner together every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.13,0:48:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we get together at 9 p.m. to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.34,0:48:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,An end-of-day meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The weekends, holidays,\Nbirthdays, and Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.81,0:48:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We spend them together all\Nyear 'round. It's safe to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no time for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.52,0:48:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 15 memorial services per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.73,0:48:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They say noble families in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.57,0:48:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,made their male members\Nprepare for the services,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.28,0:48:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so the sons-in-law prepare\Nfor the entire service,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.70,0:48:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but their sons never help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.20,0:48:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.37,0:48:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you need a place where\Nyou can be away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.38,0:48:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.84,0:48:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your work life?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.01,0:48:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife is my boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.89,0:48:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and my father-in-law is her boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.31,0:49:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my grandfather-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,is his boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.68,0:49:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart races, and my hands tremble...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.27,0:49:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever my in-laws call.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm anxious about what they'll ask me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you distance yourself\Nfrom this stressful environment?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.11,0:49:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then divorce is the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.61,0:49:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You could move out with your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that I dislike my in-laws. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I despise my wife even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.75,0:49:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.87,0:49:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.79,0:49:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,at all about me, or how her family treats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.96,0:49:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She only cares about herself. Isn't she selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.13,0:49:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I only married into the family because of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and endured three years of this treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but she doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.47,0:49:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we got married,\Nshe said I could trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.02,0:49:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm the only one you need.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.98,0:49:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Just trust me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.73,0:49:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'll never...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.27,0:49:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}make you cry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.07,0:50:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an idiot for believing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.37,0:50:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt and upset with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.54,0:50:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.54,0:50:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just despise her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.38,0:50:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate her...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,with a passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.01,0:50:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why you want a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.55,0:50:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.30,0:50:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.43,0:50:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.52,0:50:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My father-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.23,0:50:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,despises it the most when his people...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.69,0:50:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,turn their backs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.31,0:50:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I divorce her,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.23,0:50:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll stab me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.82,0:50:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stab you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.90,0:50:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that was a figure of speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.37,0:50:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but getting stabbed might actually be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.13,0:50:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prescribe you something strong, so take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.97,0:51:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.45,0:51:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Wife{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.05,0:51:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.17,0:51:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I genuinely think I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.88,0:51:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.47,0:51:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just really grateful...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.55,0:51:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.81,0:51:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.44,0:51:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.77,0:51:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.11,0:52:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take responsibility for saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.20,0:52:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that Jinseong Group's\Nthird heir was the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.82,0:52:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you chose their eldest son.\NGo on that blind date, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.95,0:52:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But the chairman doesn't like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.46,0:52:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so how can I set my daughter up with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.26,0:52:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,when I heard that his third\Nson will inherit everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've come to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.38,0:52:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You already set up a blind\Ndate with the eldest son, a rogue,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.06,0:52:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.63,0:52:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just go to that matchmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.63,0:52:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.51,0:52:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What choice did I have when\NI heard you were no longer competent?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.48,0:52:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you serve the ladies of Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.61,0:52:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You may oversee their household matters,\Nbut your daughter is still single.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.78,0:52:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.66,0:52:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in regrets not listening\Nto me, and marrying her now-husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.08,0:52:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.91,0:52:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they getting a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.21,0:52:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be with someone\Nwho's out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.79,0:52:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Three years is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.21,0:52:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:52:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the great Hong Hae-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.96,0:53:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,will listen to me when she wants to remarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.44,0:53:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.57,0:53:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother stopped by our spa this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.45,0:53:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to come by. Why won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.00,0:53:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stressed out these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.50,0:53:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin looks dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.46,0:53:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some great serums and machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.88,0:53:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll empty out our schedule, so do stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.88,0:53:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be busy, so you don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.97,0:53:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.72,0:53:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You worry so much about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.60,0:53:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.15,0:54:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying I'll never visit your spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.32,0:54:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.28,0:54:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me feel distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.04,0:54:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You should feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be treating me...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.04,0:54:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like a friend because you think we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.13,0:54:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll be more\Ncareful. It's uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.46,0:54:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.64,0:54:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She has a nasty temper.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.10,0:54:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so obnoxious. Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.60,0:54:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The third heir of Jinseong Group...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.73,0:54:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is into vegan food these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.23,0:54:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A vegan forum will be held\Nat their hotel next Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.99,0:54:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring your daughter there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.36,0:54:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll try to set them up.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.95,0:54:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.58,0:54:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.66,0:54:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.55,0:55:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.76,0:55:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in the beauty industry...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.05,0:55:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and matchmaking wealthy families...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.93,0:55:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,all my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.35,0:55:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't know much about legal matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.60,0:55:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.69,0:55:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that Daegyeong's youngest son\Npassed away due to a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.32,0:55:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.40,0:55:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.07,0:55:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,his wife won't inherit any of his fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.45,0:55:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out, her husband had written a will...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.49,0:55:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,before they got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.54,0:55:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He said his children, nieces, or nephews...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.67,0:55:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,should inherit his fortune instead if he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.08,0:55:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but that couple never had a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.00,0:55:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, the wife could claim...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.88,0:55:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,a legal reserve of\Ninheritance and file a lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.34,0:55:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can introduce you to an attorney if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.06,0:55:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What for? I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:55:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.98,0:56:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.23,0:56:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong also wrote a\Nwill before she got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the prenuptial agreement was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.41,0:56:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a heartless one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.16,0:56:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The will said that Queens...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.04,0:56:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}would inherit all her cash,\Nstocks, and real estate...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.46,0:56:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,if something happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.00,0:56:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She said you wouldn't get anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She wrote it in such detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.13,0:56:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We use that as a template for all future wills.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.60,0:56:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.18,0:56:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think it was\Nthe marriage of the century...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.19,0:56:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that transcended all backgrounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.73,0:56:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,like the media claimed it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.73,0:56:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.15,0:56:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong didn't want a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.78,0:56:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted a slave she could\Nadd to the family register,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.78,0:56:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's when you appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.99,0:57:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're handsome and intelligent.\NIt was the best PR she could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.79,0:57:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're obedient just to her liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.92,0:57:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem was the wealth dispute,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.92,0:57:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's solved, thanks to the will.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.42,0:57:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.47,0:57:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.68,0:57:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.97,0:57:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you email it to me?\NI don't have time to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.91,0:57:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why weren't you picking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.92,0:57:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.55,0:57:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're free today. I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.80,0:57:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The car is waiting downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.89,0:57:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.81,0:58:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even tell you where we were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.73,0:58:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.85,0:58:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to go anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.64,0:58:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri's Prodigy Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.56,0:58:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"A prodigy"? That was from ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.48,0:58:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.15,0:58:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,here's what Yongdu-ri thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.82,0:58:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't mind you serving consecutive terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.86,0:59:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the general opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.41,0:59:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop by my shop later for a snack.\NThe new {\i1}makgeolli{\i0} tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.91,0:59:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're always so generous.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.29,0:59:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could give you\Nsomething better, but there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.17,0:59:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the Improper Solicitation and Graft Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.04,0:59:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The village head is also a state job,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.71,0:59:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can't be too generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.09,0:59:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I'm always grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.42,0:59:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.76,0:59:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- You understand, right?\N- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.35,0:59:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Ms. Jeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.01,0:59:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.14,0:59:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.89,0:59:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it get stuck again?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.60,0:59:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots. How can you call yourselves farmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.15,0:59:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you manage to get the cultivator...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.23,0:59:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,stuck every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.69,0:59:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.15,0:59:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.24,0:59:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not 119. I can't always come right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.83,0:59:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife used to drive a cultivator...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.75,0:59:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and catch small octopi in\NBeolgyo, Jeolla Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.16,0:59:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,before marrying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.88,0:59:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.22,1:00:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, what lovely weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.51,1:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.56,1:00:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-cheol! How are your mother's knees?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.73,1:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the same!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.06,1:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she needs to take glucosamine!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.15,1:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sit down!\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.36,1:00:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't your son taking his midterms soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.78,1:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to me? It's his work.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.61,1:00:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, you should help him memorize!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.12,1:00:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When Hyun-woo went to SNU,\NI helped him day and night...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.00,1:00:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly speed up?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.25,1:00:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to sit, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They may just look like normal\Nfarmers, but they're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.05,1:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all voters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The re-election is around\Nthe corner. You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.51,1:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Re-election, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.22,1:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to take care of our grove and our shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.64,1:00:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already juggling so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.81,1:00:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you countless times...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.73,1:00:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to give up your position?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.32,1:00:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.40,1:01:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing this for balance's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.44,1:01:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- What balance?\N- Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.95,1:01:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo's in-laws may be the\Npillars of this country's economy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.83,1:01:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but they don't have much political power.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.04,1:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our families can only have balance...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.04,1:01:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm maintaining...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,my important post as the village head.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.71,1:01:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.51,1:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hyun-woo!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.72,1:01:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even call.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.52,1:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.85,1:01:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.39,1:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here alone again?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.69,1:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.03,1:01:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.91,1:01:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks ripe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.50,1:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.38,1:02:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Move. My youngest son is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.81,1:02:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you must've been hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.57,1:02:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.21,1:02:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.37,1:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm busy. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.59,1:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo is here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.01,1:03:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.59,1:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen's Hair Salon{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.26,1:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That little scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.10,1:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even come for Dad's 60th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.35,1:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.10,1:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.52,1:03:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in both you and Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.78,1:03:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that you can't come\Nregularly or even on the holidays,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.28,1:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but shouldn't you have\Nattended Dad's 60th birthday?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.95,1:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's so heartless.\N- Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was heartless.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.83,1:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At least he knows he was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.70,1:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.96,1:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Dad. Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.71,1:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to divorce Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.01,1:04:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.34,1:04:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.47,1:04:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you're getting a divorce\Njust because of what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.68,1:04:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you? 60th birthdays are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.68,1:04:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Birthdays come every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.31,1:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Who celebrates\N60th birthdays these days?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.27,1:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget 70th too. We're\Nexpected to live longer lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.65,1:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not because of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm sure you have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.11,1:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're seeing another...?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.32,1:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.74,1:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.00,1:04:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then does Hae-in have...?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.41,1:04:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.00,1:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true either.\NIt's just too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.67,1:04:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.96,1:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an absurd reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.88,1:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm always happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.47,1:04:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.89,1:04:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad isn't always happy\Nin this marriage, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.47,1:04:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, I'm miserable,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm only able to endure it...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.68,1:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,because of the smallest happiness...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel once in a blue moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.23,1:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's marriage. That's life.\N- You know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.61,1:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.73,1:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm with your\Nmom because I love her?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.53,1:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.66,1:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.00,1:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I love you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.46,1:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but if love is the only thing you feel,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.33,1:05:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,then that'll be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.08,1:05:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I hope you live a long life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.42,1:05:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.71,1:05:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We still fail to see eye-to-eye,\Ndespite being married for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.14,1:05:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.18,1:05:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.81,1:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.94,1:05:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard\Nbefore making this decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.69,1:05:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.74,1:05:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.08,1:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.04,1:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Get out, you scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.00,1:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.00,1:06:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know I had to make sacrifices for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.63,1:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What sacrifices?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.47,1:06:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even go to college,\Nbecause our parents sold...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.18,1:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,all our cows to send you to Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you forget that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.35,1:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you so shameless?\NYou couldn't go to college...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.77,1:06:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,because you failed at attendance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.48,1:06:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy is so naïve.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.28,1:06:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Grand\NPrince Yang-nyeong acted out?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.57,1:06:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.03,1:06:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.62,1:06:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He sacrificed himself and acted\Nout for his brother Se-jong's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.66,1:06:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I enjoyed acting out?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.25,1:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up our parents'\Nexpectations, hopes, and cows...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,just for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.09,1:06:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.13,1:06:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.50,1:06:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to make sacrifices as the eldest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.51,1:07:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, Ms. Baek Mi-seon.\NThumbelina of Yongdu Carriage Gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.64,1:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.22,1:07:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That was ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.73,1:07:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.69,1:07:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to pressure you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.44,1:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You already are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.82,1:07:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm only worried about Dad.\N- What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.99,1:07:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how happy he\Nwas to marry you off to Queens?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.08,1:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he has no appetite,\Nbut finishes a bowl of rice soup...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.84,1:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,every time Queens' stock prices go up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.87,1:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He always enjoyed rice soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.42,1:07:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.46,1:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.63,1:07:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A son from this tiny town gets a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.67,1:07:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be humiliated! Wake up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.43,1:07:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Seoul or Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.72,1:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Yongdu-ri.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.85,1:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Chang-sik\Ngot divorced two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.02,1:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're still talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.35,1:07:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.35,1:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All the ladies at my hair salon...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.31,1:07:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,still wonder why he got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.27,1:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. However...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.78,1:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no one will talk about him\Nif you get divorced, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this because of your gym's rent?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.62,1:08:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of Gyeong-jun who's studying abroad?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.83,1:08:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you need to send him money?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.66,1:08:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you using me to live comfortable lives,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.56,1:08:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,just like how Sim-cheong was\Nsold for 300 sacks of rice?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.17,1:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh. No, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.30,1:08:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't use you if it was that much,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.13,1:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- but it's not.\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.18,1:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.10,1:08:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.56,1:08:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Hyun-woo!\N- Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.39,1:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay the night!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.95,1:09:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.12,1:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.91,1:10:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.79,1:10:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.96,1:10:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.71,1:10:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I do too, so let me go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.17,1:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.30,1:10:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.31,1:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.60,1:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have three months left.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.45,1:10:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I said we had to go somewhere today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.37,1:10:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.58,1:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the doctor said I was dying,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.71,1:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I had three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.21,1:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.97,1:11:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.76,1:11:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.22,1:11:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor said I only\Nhave three months to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.31,1:11:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.77,1:11:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did you want to say?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You had something to say. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.90,1:11:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.82,1:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that's important right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.87,1:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it. I know you have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.88,1:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.42,1:11:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- So what...\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.51,1:11:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...I wanted to say was...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.56,1:11:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.68,1:12:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.48,1:12:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"About today,"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.52,1:12:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"and everything I've done."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.19,1:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"It won't happen ever again.\NI'll treat you better."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.24,1:12:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.49,1:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.70,1:12:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but you only have three months\Nto live? How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.71,1:12:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I live without you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.96,1:12:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.80,1:12:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.47,1:12:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.27,1:12:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.35,1:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.91,1:12:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.24,1:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.26,1:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please give them a round of applause...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.39,1:13:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as they begin their new journey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.69,1:13:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please clap and cheer even louder...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.44,1:13:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to wish them the very best.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.66,1:13:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please look at the camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.70,1:13:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please laugh on the count of three.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.62,1:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.76,1:14:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek, congratulations on the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.64,1:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say something to yourself in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.98,1:14:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Hyun-woo from the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.40,1:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.03,1:14:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One? Two?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.61,1:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, though,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.61,1:14:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,because all I need is Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.45,1:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you still remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.75,1:14:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,how much you love her,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.29,1:14:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,even to this day.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.05,1:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make her cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.17,1:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.68,1:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must I answer that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be something nice to watch in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.93,1:14:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be too busy with life\Nto watch this in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.18,1:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.27,1:14:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Hae-in from the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.23,1:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt you're watching this,\Nbut if you are, why are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.61,1:14:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn this off and get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.07,1:14:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ask how you're doing,\Nsince I know you'll be doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.87,1:15:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be just as pretty, healthy,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.91,1:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and the most successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.62,1:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With Hyun-woo, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.09,1:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.20,1:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You only have three months\Nto live? How is that possible?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}If you can't live without me...\NDo you want to die together?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.04,1:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm just happy...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.42,1:15:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}that I can escape from them safe and sound.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.84,1:15:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Put your heart and soul into loving her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.01,1:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm that materialistic?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.39,1:16:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll be sitting here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.26,1:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- Are you okay?\N- They should just argue instead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.93,1:16:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}How can we change, after\Nyears of living as strangers?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.60,1:16:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Watch out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.35,1:16:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I thought of Hae-in now and then,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.31,1:16:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}so it feels odd to meet her husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.32,1:16:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I don't even like Hong Hae-in.\NWhy would I feel jealous?{\i0}
